  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: 13+ Str</em></p>\n<p>You've developed the skills necessary to hold your own in close-quarters grappling. You gain the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>You have advantage on attack rolls against a creature you are grappling.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You can use your action to try to pin a creature grappled by you. To do so, make another grapple check. If you succeed, you and the creature are both restrained until the grapple ends.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
